Brie Larson, bloody Brie Larson here to ruin
everyone's day, ends up going toe to toe with

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:34.620
him and we see Thor put an end to the greatest
threat to the party that anyone has ever seen.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:38.820
He ends up using a hammerang technique and
this might be a subtle nod to when he pulled

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:43.920
Stormbreaker to his hand in the beginning
on Endgame...but this time he didn't miss.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:46.070
Ammiright...bloody party pooper.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:51.150
Like Captain America did in the Avengers she
tells him to put the hammer down but rather

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:55.130
hitting it against his shield, he sends this
Cap into Stone henge.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:59.660
Stone Henge actually appeared in the MCU during
Thor the Darkworld and it was the location

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.670
Erik Selvig travelled to when he went a bit
crazy.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:07.070
This fight takes place across the planet and
our next stopping point is the Grand Canyon

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.520
where we see both characters duke it out in
one of the best battles in the season so far.

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:16.270
I love how they flyover the skyline of the
planet and it feels very Godly as they crash

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:18.980
into the clouds whilst thunder erupts around
them.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:23.460
Thor end ends up beating her by placing Mlojnir
on her chest and this is similar to what he

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:26.160
did to Loki at the end of his solo film.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:30.320
Thor slams her in timeout and she ends up
being branded a party pooper in a moment that

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.960
feels like it was written by the quartering.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:37.520
Back on the helicarrier she brings up her
pet cat Goose but at this time I'm sure he

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:39.750
was still on Earth and under Fury's care.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.250
Or she, we're not sexist here.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:49.400
Now they want Captain Marvel to take down
Thor but due to her power she's just not ready

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.529
to nuke the planet in order to take him down.

00:15:51.529 --> 00:15:54.860
Instead we need a different woman for the
job and this comes in the form of Jane who

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:58.910
wants to settle the situation without destroying
North Dakota.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:03.100
After Loki destroys Thor's phone Jane comes
up with a plan to reach out to Frigga who'll

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.320
put an end to the party like any other parent
would.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:10.220
Across the planet we see Sutur chatting up
the statue of Liberty and he says he's got

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:14.330
a crown too which was of course the source
of his power in Ragnarok.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:18.820
However he ends up melting her arm off and
we see the destruction that he and the frost

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:20.190
giants bring to the planet.

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:24.950
They end up creating ice structures at mount
rushmore and this includes Loki crown thorns

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:27.990
on Abrhama Lincon and George Washington.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:32.220
We jump to Sydney and see that the harbour
bridge has been turned into a dancefloor.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:37.000
Now on the dancefloor we can catch Korg busting
out the robot and sucking on a pacifier.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.700
This shot has several characters from the
MCU and next to him we can of course catch

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.700
Mantis.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.460
Behind her is a Ravager and behind him I believe
we can catch what is a Kree Guard though his

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:43.460
back is turned.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:49.650
There is also a Skrull and one of the errrm...fembots
from Guardians Of The Galaxy Volume 2 that

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.650
Yondu...serviced.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.840
Think I can say that and still keep it PG.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:57.470
There's also an Asgardian guard which I will
now call an Asgard and I think this might

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:01.290
actually be the same one that Loki immitated
during Thor the Dark World.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:05.620
He did this after faking his death and used
it to take the throne but let me know below

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.750
if you think it's really him or not.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.870
We can also catch Meek and Valkyrie and just
before Thor goes to slide down the opera house

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:15.400
he's once more approached by Captain Marvel.

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:20.680
However Jane and Darcy make a noise so loud
that it snaps Heimdell out of his slumber

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.420
and he pulls her through to Asgard.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:27.339
Here she comes face to face with Frigga as
the battle rages on Earth and just as the

00:17:27.339 --> 00:17:32.240
Nukes are about to be launched, Frigga projects
herself to the planet and gives her son a

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.060
right good talking to.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:39.309
This de-escalates the problem and Crossbones
feels bad they didn't get to fire the Nukes

00:17:39.309 --> 00:17:42.610
because at this point he would have been a
part of Hydra.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:47.590
Feel kinda bad for Thor as no one likes to
be caught throwing a party by their parents.

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:52.050
We see Thor slowly start to become more like
his father as he wants to clean up and he

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.270
sees it as his duty to do so.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:58.490
As Frigga races towards Earth he digs deep
into his powers and commands the guests to

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:01.210
put everything back to where it was.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:06.900
This includes Stone Henge, the Statue Of Libertie's
arm, Mount Rushmore and he puts the leaning

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:14.720
Tower Of Piza straight which yeah...obviously
it's meant to lean.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:19.750
Frigga is suspicious but with a little help
from Captain Marvel she ends up buying it.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:24.280
Thor says so Tiny yet contains so much and
this is of course symbolising his arc of how

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:26.420
he viewed others doing a 180.

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:31.300
However the game is given away when Mlojnir
returns covered in markings from the days

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:32.300
before.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:35.720
Kinda reminds me of that time I threw a party
and left one bottle cap on the carpet and

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.720
got caught.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:43.020
He ends up taking Jane on a date and we get
somewhat of a happy ending until Ultron Infinite

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.460
arrives through a portal.

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:48.850
He carries not only the infinity stones with
him but also Visions face and I'm guessing

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.940
that this is from a reality in which he ended
up shifting his consciouness into the synthetic

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.800
body which made him unstoppable.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:59.740
Now because this episode of What If has ended
on a Cliffhanger I know a lot of people will

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:04.200
be a bit bummed out but as we've been saying
at the end of all of our episodes, there is

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.410
hope of a teamup coming for the finale in
two weeks time.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:11.360
In the second trailer for the show we could
catch several characters in an avengers-esque

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:17.080
lineup that included Killmonger, Thanora,
T'Challord and lastly Party Thor.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.700
This shows that the characters are all definitely
going to be interacting at some point and

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:25.010
though Marvel are infamous for putting fake
things in their teasers, there is more evidence

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.430
to support it.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:30.550
Last week the studio released a mid season
sneak peak look at what's to come and in that

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:33.520
we could catch Thor meeting with Strange Supreme.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:37.160
Strange Supreme seems to be the connector
between every universe as we already know

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:41.270
from the second trailer that he's going to
be meeting with Captain Carter too so my guess

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:45.731
is that he breaks out of his reality and then
starts to unite the multiversal hereos in

00:19:45.731 --> 00:19:47.860
order to stop a greater threat.

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:51.559
In this clip Thor also mentioned Zombies so
my guess would be that they pull one of the

00:19:51.559 --> 00:19:54.600
survivors from Episode 5 and form a team with
them.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:59.320
Thor has also been spotted in the teaser fighting
Ultron Bots in Las Vegas and therefore we

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:03.210
can assume that the leaks about the finale
being an Ultron centred entry are true.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:07.429
If you saw the Hundai ad then you'll know
that showed several of the heroes fighting

00:20:07.429 --> 00:20:11.700
against a legion of Ultron Bots and it's likely
that that is what will happen when the Season

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.300
draws to a close in Episode 9.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:17.190
As for next week we are apparently going to
have a Gamora centric one in which she ends

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.520
up wearing Thanos' armour.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:23.370
It could be that he was killed and that she
ended up taking on her father's legacy in

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.059
attempting to balance the universe.

00:20:25.059 --> 00:20:29.100
We'll soon find out but I think that that
would be a pretty cool concept.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:33.370
Now as for my thoughts on the episode I think
this was probably one of the weaker ones for

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:38.950
me and though it had a lot of cameos I just
wasn't as gripped as I was with the other

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:39.950
entries in the show.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:44.400
I dunno if it's because I'm a DC head at heart
but I just love dark concepts and Infinity

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:49.510
War is my favourite MCU movie because it takes
a lot of the fun elements and subverts them

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:50.510
for a real gut punch.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:56.840
Those are probably why I love the darker episodes
of What If but this was still pretty good.

00:20:56.840 --> 00:21:01.580
I know a lot of people have been saying that
the Tone of What If, namely the back to back

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:07.110
Tony deaths kinda made the season seem very
bleak, so if this was originally episode 5

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:11.200
then that might have brought a bit more levity
to the situation so it didn't feel like gut

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.200
punches back to back.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:17.660
Obviously we don't really know but it's led
to the series feeling a bit depressing.

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:22.130
Which is pretty much exactly how you feel
on a Wednesday.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:25.440
Anyway that's pretty much the video and obviously
I'd love to hear your comments on the episode

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.440
below.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:31.490
We're running a competition right now and
giving away 3 copies of the Zack Snyder DC

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.200
Trilogy on the 30th Of September.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.530
All you have to do to be in with a chance
of winning is like the video, make sure you

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:40.750
subscribe with notifications on and drop a
comment below with your thoughts on the episode.

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:43.900
We pick the comments at random at the end
of the month and the winners of the last one

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.570
are on screen right now so message me @heavySpoilers
if that's you.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:50.650
If you want something else to watch then make
sure you check out our breakdown of perfect

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:51.660
scene in Spider-Man Homecoming.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:58.500
We break down the entire thing so it's definitely
worth checking out if you wanna know more.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:03.740
With that out the way thank you for sitting
through the video, I’ve been Paul and I’ll

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:04.740
see you next time.

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:05.249
Take care, Peace

